      "description": {
        "en": "Turns conversations from your agents (Claude Code, Codex and others) into searchable verbatim logs, shared with every agent as one skill so each can look up what was said elsewhere. Original wording kept: no summaries, no embeddings, no model calls.",
        "zh": "把各个 agent（Claude Code、Codex 等）的对话整理成可检索的原文日志，以一个共用技能提供给所有 agent，让它们能查到彼此聊过什么。保留原话，不做摘要，不用向量，不调用模型。"
      },
